{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Orbcraft Survivors</strong> is a <strong>time survival game</strong> with <strong>roguelite elements</strong>, where you craft orbs and enhance them with powerful perks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Merge identical orbs</strong> to strengthen them into more powerful forms. <strong>Apply perks</strong> to further enhance their effects. Experiment with different combinations to unleash <strong>devastating magic</strong> and survive relentless enemy waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/CollectOrbs.png?t=1743737348\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each character can equip up to <strong>6+ orbs</strong>, each with unique skills. Merge orbs to make them stronger, and unleash <strong>Level 3 orbs</strong> to dominate the battlefield!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/collect_merge_orbs.gif?t=1743737348\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/PerkCombo.png?t=1743737348\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With <strong>over 50 perks</strong> of varying rarities, every battle offers new strategies and combinations. Discover powerful synergies, <strong>test your luck and tactics,</strong> and create a fresh experience in every run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/endless_combinations.gif?t=1743737348\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/UniqueSkills_Talent.png?t=1743737348\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wield each character\u2019s unique skills</strong> at the right moment. Gather gold to unlock <strong>powerful talents</strong> and enhance your character\u2019s potential. Invest wisely, break your limits, and become the ultimate survivor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/uniqueskills_talents.gif?t=1743737348\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3327240?t=1743737348","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/ec2f653c0b46db4245671c63bc600b2fa94a2166/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743737348","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/4eb7a142bbb42cf13ff3eea19520b1e3e65aaa48/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743737348","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/4eb7a142bbb42cf13ff3eea19520b1e3e65aaa48/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743737348","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Orbcraft Survivors</strong> is a <strong>time survival game</strong> with <strong>roguelite elements</strong>, where you craft orbs and enhance them with powerful perks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Merge identical orbs</strong> to strengthen them into more powerful forms. <strong>Apply perks</strong> to further enhance their effects. Experiment with different combinations to unleash <strong>devastating magic</strong> and survive relentless enemy waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/CollectOrbs.png?t=1743737348\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each character can equip up to <strong>6+ orbs</strong>, each with unique skills. Merge orbs to make them stronger, and unleash <strong>Level 3 orbs</strong> to dominate the battlefield!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/collect_merge_orbs.gif?t=1743737348\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/PerkCombo.png?t=1743737348\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With <strong>over 50 perks</strong> of varying rarities, every battle offers new strategies and combinations. Discover powerful synergies, <strong>test your luck and tactics,</strong> and create a fresh experience in every run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/endless_combinations.gif?t=1743737348\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/UniqueSkills_Talent.png?t=1743737348\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wield each character\u2019s unique skills</strong> at the right moment. Gather gold to unlock <strong>powerful talents</strong> and enhance your character\u2019s potential. Invest wisely, break your limits, and become the ultimate survivor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/uniqueskills_talents.gif?t=1743737348\" /></p>","developers":["TMA"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"